{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Oust",
    "steam_appid": 1916790,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1916790/extras/cfb845593d4a488d7d39ddd244391e62.poster.avif?t=1699282784\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1916790/extras/cfb845593d4a488d7d39ddd244391e62.webm?t=1699282784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Oust is an asymmetrical side scrolling platformer game that blends strategy, rpg, and pvp elements into a beautiful, easy-to-pick-up game. All players spawn into the beautiful, procedurally-generated world as peasants with the goal of taking the crown to become king for the longest amount of time. As a peasant, you must find equipment, construct siege weapons, and gather support to overthrow the king. As king, enlist guards and build fortifications to remain in power.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1916790/extras/d9d3d9ca8a1ff06d36c2f490ec3d66da.poster.avif?t=1699282784\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1916790/extras/d9d3d9ca8a1ff06d36c2f490ec3d66da.webm?t=1699282784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>    All players begin the game as a peasant. As a peasant, you must take the crown by force. Cast unique spells, start revolts, recruit mercenaries, purchase equipment, and explore ruins for rare items all to overthrow the crown.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1916790/extras/e7292afca98a284b4d091c0ad4ef45a4.poster.avif?t=1699282784\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1916790/extras/e7292afca98a284b4d091c0ad4ef45a4.apng?t=1699282784\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br>    When king, keep the crown at all costs from others trying to overthrow you. Enlist knights to keep order, massacre revolts, tax peasants, and construct walls for defense.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1916790/extras/d10de1db423859c8b0731b6d630923ea.poster.avif?t=1699282784\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1916790/extras/d10de1db423859c8b0731b6d630923ea.webm?t=1699282784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>    Do everything you can to survive in the unforgiving, procedurally generated world. Construct buildings, craft weapons, and fend off animals.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1916790/extras/cfb845593d4a488d7d39ddd244391e62.poster.avif?t=1699282784\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1916790/extras/cfb845593d4a488d7d39ddd244391e62.webm?t=1699282784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Oust is an asymmetrical side scrolling platformer game that blends strategy, rpg, and pvp elements into a beautiful, easy-to-pick-up game. All players spawn into the beautiful, procedurally-generated world as peasants with the goal of taking the crown to become king for the longest amount of time. As a peasant, you must find equipment, construct siege weapons, and gather support to overthrow the king. As king, enlist guards and build fortifications to remain in power.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1916790/extras/d9d3d9ca8a1ff06d36c2f490ec3d66da.poster.avif?t=1699282784\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1916790/extras/d9d3d9ca8a1ff06d36c2f490ec3d66da.webm?t=1699282784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>    All players begin the game as a peasant. As a peasant, you must take the crown by force. Cast unique spells, start revolts, recruit mercenaries, purchase equipment, and explore ruins for rare items all to overthrow the crown.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1916790/extras/e7292afca98a284b4d091c0ad4ef45a4.poster.avif?t=1699282784\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1916790/extras/e7292afca98a284b4d091c0ad4ef45a4.apng?t=1699282784\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br>    When king, keep the crown at all costs from others trying to overthrow you. Enlist knights to keep order, massacre revolts, tax peasants, and construct walls for defense.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1916790/extras/d10de1db423859c8b0731b6d630923ea.poster.avif?t=1699282784\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1916790/extras/d10de1db423859c8b0731b6d630923ea.webm?t=1699282784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>    Do everything you can to survive in the unforgiving, procedurally generated world. Construct buildings, craft weapons, and fend off animals.",
    "short_description": "Oust is a multiplayer, king of the hill style game where you and up to 3 other players fight for the right to rule the kingdom as king. As a peasant, find equipment, survive the wilderness and overthrow the king. As king, strengthen your defenses in order to hold your crown as long as possible",
